 "remarks": "The only 3-bedroom condo with true one-level living (NO STAIRS) on the market in Norwalk right now: welcome to 1 Linden Street. This spacious unit is located on the first level, quietly tucked in the back of the complex. Enter into a hallway with a laundry closet and a coat closet. The home has a central entertaining area with a large living room, dining room, and kitchen. The living room has a large slider out to a small back opening onto the courtyard. There are 3 large bedrooms, including the primary suite, complete with an updated bathroom and walk-in closet. The second bedroom is even bigger, with double exposure creating a bright room, and is currently being used as a den. The last bedroom is also unusually large for a condominium. These two bedrooms share a full bathroom. Everything in this condo is impeccably kept, and it's move-in ready. There's room for some updating, but it can be done over time. The complex is close to Main Avenue and all the shopping and restaurants you might imagine. Dolce Cafe, Stop & Shop, the Merritt Parkway, and the Merritt 7 buildings are all within a minute's drive. The complex features a pool and plenty of guest parking. With access to both Norwalk beaches, a storage unit on site, and a pet-friendly complex, this unit won't last on the market. Seeking cash buyers only!",
